  "summary": "Malicious code in casinolabcasino (npm)",
  "details": "Casinolabcasino@1.0.0 is an inert npm package (index.js exports an empty object, no install scripts, no dependencies) whose only content is a French-language casino-affiliate marketing README. It contains no functional code and performs no network activity; its observable content is SEO/affiliate spam promoting casinolabfrance[.]fr and gaeconseil[.]fr. The package is published as part of a bulk casino-affiliate spam campaign.",
